3. CONTRIBUTIONS

   You may modify WageRoute and push your work to a separate branch in this
   repository, or to your own fork, provided you follow the project's
   contribution standards: never push directly to `main`; keep each change
   focused; make sure the tests, type checks and build pass; do not commit
   databases, backups, exported CSVs, credentials or signing material; and
   update the documentation when behaviour or data compatibility changes.

   Submit contributions as a pull request. A maintainer reviews and merges
   them; contributors do not merge their own changes.

   By submitting a contribution you grant the Licensor a non-exclusive,
   royalty-free, sublicensable and transferable license to use, reproduce,
