   is the only route by which a modified WageRoute reaches other users.

   Pushing a contribution branch to this repository, or creating a fork through
   the hosting platform's own mechanism solely to prepare contributions, is
   permitted and is not distribution. A branch or fork may not be operated as a
   place from which others download WageRoute.

